  <div class="page-head tight">
    <p class="kicker">Three conjectures &middot; Three integrated Parts</p>
    <h2 id="conjectures-title">The Complete Public Argument</h2>
    <p class="lede muted">The restored r3.5 reading room now carries the newer programme inside it. Part I develops Eternal Integration, Part II develops the Rankin Skeletal Splice, and Part III develops Seams and Return. Stable codes preserve the complete research sequence.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="focus-pillars">
